      "instruction": "Open http://127.0.0.1:8069/ and sign in with username admin and password {{env:APP_PASSWORD}}. Then create a new contact (customer) named exactly '{{runid}} Bench Customer' with the City field set to 'Benchville' (use the address/city field on the contact form). Save the record and report back the customer name and city exactly as shown on the saved form. Note: do not wait for network idle, the app long-polls; wait for concrete page state instead.",
      "skill": "s_239534",
      "params": {
        "v2": "http://127.0.0.1:8069/",
        "v3": "admin",
        "v4": "{{env:APP_PASSWORD}}",
