    {
      "id": "02-open",
      "instruction": "In Odoo, open the Sales app and create a new quotation (RFQ/sales order) with the customer set to '{{runid}} Bench Customer' — the customer field is an autocomplete dropdown, so you must pick the option from the dropdown, not just type the name. Add exactly ONE order line: pick any product from the product catalogue (again via the autocomplete dropdown, choosing an actual option), and set the quantity to 3. Let the app fill in the unit price automatically. Save the quotation and report: (a) the product name you chose, (b) the unit price the app filled in on the line, (c) the Untaxed Amount total the app computes, and (d) the quotation reference/name shown on the form. Do not wait for network idle; wait for concrete page state.",
